sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant Grid as Grid/API Aggregator
    participant Orders as Order Service
    participant Customers as Customer Service
    participant Products as Product Service

    UI->>Grid: page 0, size 100, sort by orderedAt desc
    Grid->>Orders: fetch candidate orders
    Grid->>Customers: fetch related customers
    Grid->>Products: fetch related products
    Grid->>Grid: join rows in memory
    Grid->>Grid: sort full joined dataset
    Grid->>Grid: page after global sort
    Grid-->>UI: first 100 rows
